   "line": [
    "Nc6"
   ],
   "spoken": "So forget the extra pawn and develop. The bishop to f5 is one idea, but the knight to c6 is better — it counter-attacks the pawn. If White pushes d5, the knight simply slides into e5, a knight up."
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
